WEBVTT

01:00:59.704 --> 01:01:03.246
how many people come through it to give
us a couple of stories of its impact.

01:01:03.413 --> 01:01:07.038
Yeah. So you basically apply as a
handful of people and an idea,

01:01:07.079 --> 01:01:08.996
maybe a prototype and say,

01:01:08.996 --> 01:01:11.538
I would like to start a company
and will you please fund me?

01:01:11.829 --> 01:01:14.913
And we review those applications and
we I shouldn't say we anymore.

01:01:14.913 --> 01:01:17.413
I guess they fund four hundred
companies a year.

01:01:17.829 --> 01:01:20.288
You get about one hundred and fifty
thousand dollars while she takes about

01:01:20.288 --> 01:01:23.663
seven percent ownership and then gives you
lots of advice and then networking

01:01:23.663 --> 01:01:26.204
and sort of this like fast track
program for starting a startup.

01:01:27.704 --> 01:01:29.079
I haven't looked at this in a while,

01:01:29.079 --> 01:01:31.871
but at one point a significant
fraction of